      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## KDX Wildcard Studio – 2. Text to image\n\n`prompt` from the console goes straight into CLIP Text Encode. Pick your own checkpoint in **Load Checkpoint**.\n\n- Every image moves the counter; after `repeat` images the next enabled template follows.\n- After the last template of a category, its **on_end** decides: next category, loop, or stop.\n- Drag a generated image back into ComfyUI: the node shows 📌 and repeats the exact same prompt (counter paused). **Clear pin** returns to the plan.\n- For an identical *image*, set the KSampler seed to **fixed** as well."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## KDX Wildcard Studio – 2. Text to image\n\n`prompt` from the console goes straight into CLIP Text Encode. Pick your own checkpoint in **Load Checkpoint**.\n\n- Every image moves the counter; after `repeat` images the next enabled template follows.\n- After the last template of a category, its **on_end** decides: next category, loop, or stop.\n- Drag a generated image back into ComfyUI: the node shows 📌 and repeats the exact same prompt (counter paused). **Clear pin** returns to the plan.\n- For an identical *image*, set the KSampler seed to **fixed** as well."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
